{"meta":{"id":"navigation","category":"it/syntax/java/servlet","title":"페이지 이동 (forward · redirect) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"RequestDispatcher.forward, response.sendRedirect, alert 스크립트 출력 후 이동","tags":["java","f-navigation"],"color":"cyan","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-cyan","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-cyan-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-50 text-cyan-700 border border-cyan-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">페이지 이동 (forward · redirect) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-cyan-50/70 border border-cyan-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> RequestDispatcher.forward, response.sendRedirect, alert 스크립트 출력 후 이동</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">페이지 이동 3가지</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">// 1. forward — 서버 안에서 이동, 주소창 그대로, request 값 유지\r\nString viewPage = &quot;/WEB-INF/views/result.jsp&quot;;\r\nRequestDispatcher dispatcher = request.getRequestDispatcher(viewPage);\r\ndispatcher.forward(request, response);\r\n\r\n// 2. redirect — 브라우저에 새 주소로 다시 요청하게 함, request 값 사라짐\r\nresponse.sendRedirect(request.getContextPath() + &quot;/main&quot;);\r\n\r\n// 3. 스크립트 출력 — 알림창(alert) 후 이동\r\nresponse.setContentType(&quot;text/html; charset=UTF-8&quot;);\r\nPrintWriter out = response.getWriter();\r\nout.println(&quot;&lt;script&gt;&quot;);\r\nout.println(&quot;alert(&#x27;확인 안내 창&#x27;);&quot;);\r\nout.println(&quot;location.href=&#x27;&quot; + request.getContextPath() + &quot;/주소/파일명.jsp&#x27;;&quot;);\r\nout.println(&quot;&lt;/script&gt;&quot;);</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">forward vs redirect</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\"></th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">forward</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">sendRedirect</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">요청 횟수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1번 (서버 내부 이동)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2번 (브라우저가 다시 요청)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">주소창</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">처음 주소 그대로</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">새 주소로 바뀜</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">request 값</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">유지</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">사라짐 (session · 파라미터로 전달)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-cyan-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">주 용도</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">조회 결과를 JSP 로 보여줄 때</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">등록 · 수정 후 이동 (새로고침 중복 방지)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> JSP › 페이지 이동, Spring › redirect:, JavaScript › location.href</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet/navigation","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"servlet","title":"서블릿 (웹)","path":"it/syntax/java/servlet"}],"hasImage":false}